IRB-KD research code release

This repository contains a modified Ultralytics YOLO framework. The local
version marker is 8.0.114; it is not an unmodified upstream distribution.
Upstream project: https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
Existing copyright and license headers have been retained.
LICENSE is copied from the upstream v8.0.114 release:
https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/blob/v8.0.114/LICENSE

Publication preparation on 2026-10-23 adds command-line path arguments,
portable dataset paths, archived parameter files, and packaging/documentation.
The archived distillation implementations and coefficients are preserved.
